{'symbol': 'VICI', 'date': '2022-06-06 17:24:00', 'title': "VICI PROPERTIES INC. ANNOUNCES FIRST TRANSACTION WITH CABOT AND ENTRY INTO ‘DESTINATION GOLF EXPERIENCE' SECTOR", 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--VICI PROPERTIES INC. (NYSE: VICI) (“VICI,” “VICI PROPERTIES” OR THE “COMPANY”), AN EXPERIENTIAL REAL ESTATE INVESTMENT TRUST, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A DELAYED DRAW TERM LOAN FACILITY FOR UP TO $120 MILLION (THE “LOAN FACILITY”) AND A PURCHASE AND SALE AGREEMENT WITH CABOT, A DEVELOPER, OWNER AND OPERATOR OF WORLD-CLASS DESTINATION GOLF RESORTS AND COMMUNITIES. THE PROCEEDS OF THE LOAN FACILITY WILL BE USED TO FUND CABOT'S PROPERTY-WIDE TRANSFORMATION"}